  "body": "Split from #1244 (PR #1252 added the troubleshooting page, about 24 entries across posting, verify, setups, tools, GPU and writing).\n\n**Still owed from #1244's Done means:** entries for model import (wrong scale, unsupported or corrupt file, reduced-fidelity STEP), turning, wire/sinker EDM and plasma refusals; and the suggested test that every message stem listed on the page still exists in `crates/` (so the page can't drift).\n\n**Done means:** those entries added (each message grepped from the source), and a test (e.g. in xtask or app tests) reading the page's message stems and failing when one is gone from the source.\n",
